Architectural Prevention Controls
Private Verification Architecture
Users are not publicly identified by age.

Public profiles display:

✓ Verified Member
The Platform privately maintains:

Realm Assignment
Verification Status
APS Status
This reduces age-targeting risks.

Realm Separation
Teen and Adult environments operate independently.

The system prevents:

Cross-Realm Messaging
Cross-Realm Invitations
Cross-Realm Friend Requests
Cross-Realm Voice Chat
Cross-Realm Gifting
Cross-Realm Trading
All restrictions are enforced server-side.

Access Control
All access decisions are made by backend services.

Clients cannot:

Override Permissions
Modify Realm Access
Change Verification Status
