Abuse Prevention Commitment
MingleLife is committed to creating a safe and welcoming virtual world where users can socialize, create, explore, and build communities.

Through private verification, realm separation, proactive moderation, user controls, and human oversight, the Platform seeks to reduce abuse while respecting privacy, freedom of expression, and user autonomy.
